# One line ending in the repository AND in every checkout. web/test_api.py
# compares the gitignored web/api/ copies byte for byte against the root
# files; with core.autocrlf=true on Windows and no attributes, a merge rewrote
# the root .py files CRLF while the copies kept the LF the last sync had read
# - content identical, three FAILs on a clean tree (Sep 8 2026). The index was
# already LF throughout, so this changes what a checkout writes, not history.
* text=auto eol=lf
